@startsalt
' Screen: Custom Dashboard Builder
' Related user stories:
'   US-100: As a QA engineer, I want to build custom dashboards by selecting and arranging widgets
'   US-101: As a QA engineer, I want to configure each widget with filters (script, date range)
'   US-102: As a QA engineer, I want to save and clone dashboards for different reporting needs

{
  ' Page header
  {
    <b>Dashboard Builder</b>  ·  <i>Q2 Agent Regression Overview</i>  "Q2 Agent Regression Overview"
    | [Save Dashboard] | [Clone] | [Preview] | [← Back]
  }
  ==
  ' Three-column layout: Palette | Canvas | Config
  {
    ' === LEFT: Widget Palette ===
    {+
      <b>Widget Palette</b>
      <i>Drag to canvas →</i>
      --
      {+
        <b>📈 Trend Chart</b>
        <i>Score over time</i>
        <i>per agent/script</i>
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>🟥 Heatmap</b>
        <i>Agent × expectation</i>
        <i>score matrix</i>
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>⊞ Cohort Table</b>
        <i>Cohort pass/warn/fail</i>
        <i>summary table</i>
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>☰ Run List</b>
        <i>Recent runs with</i>
        <i>status + verdict</i>
      }
      --
      {+
        <b>◉ Metric Card</b>
        <i>Single KPI: avg score,</i>
        <i>pass rate, cost</i>
      }
    }
    |
    ' === CENTER: Canvas (2x2 grid) ===
    {+
      <b>Canvas</b>  <i>2 × 2 grid · 2 of 4 slots filled</i>
      --
      {
        ' Row 1
        {+
          <b>📈 Trend Chart</b>  [⚙] [✕]
          Script: checkout-flow v3
          Date: last 30d
          --
          <i>[Chart rendered here]</i>
          <i>gpt-4o: ↑ 0.89</i>
          <i>opus:   → 0.74</i>
          <i>turbo:  ↓ 0.61</i>
        }
        |
        {+
          <b>⊞ Cohort Table</b>  [⚙] [✕]
          Cohort: Q2 Regression
          --
          <i>[Table rendered here]</i>
          gpt-4o  | 0.88 | <color:green>PASS</color>
          opus    | 0.76 | <color:orange>WARN</color>
          turbo   | 0.61 | <color:red>FAIL</color>
          haiku   | 0.69 | <color:orange>WARN</color>
        }
      }
      --
      {
        ' Row 2
        {+
          <color:grey><i>+ Drop widget here</i></color>
          " "
          " "
        }
        |
        {+
          <color:grey><i>+ Drop widget here</i></color>
          " "
          " "
        }
      }
    }
    |
    ' === RIGHT: Widget Config Panel ===
    {+
      <b>Widget Config</b>
      <i>Editing: Trend Chart</i>
      --
      <b>Title</b>
      "Score Trend — Q2     "
      --
      <b>Script Filter</b>
      ^  checkout-flow v3  ^
      --
      <b>Agent Filter</b>
      ^  All Agents  ^
      --
      <b>Persona Filter</b>
      ^  All Personas  ^
      --
      <b>Date Range</b>
      ^  Last 30 days  ^
      --
      <b>Show threshold bands</b>
      (X) Yes  ( ) No
      --
      <b>Granularity</b>
      ^  Daily  ^
      --
      [  Apply Config  ]
    }
  }
  ==
  ' Footer
  {
    <i>Last saved: 5 min ago</i>  |  [Save Dashboard]  |  [Clone Dashboard]  |  [Delete Dashboard]
  }
}
@endsalt
